    "directions": [
      "In a bowl, add cauliflower, salt to taste, water and mix it well.",
      "Keep it aside to soak for a while.",
      "Strain the cauliflower and transfer it into the tray or bowl.",
      "Keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a bowl, add ginger, green chili, tender coriander stems and curd.",
      "Transfer it to a mixer grinder jar and grind it into a smooth paste.",
      "Keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a kadai, add mustard oil, once it's smoky hot, add cumin seeds and let it splutter.",
      "Add prepared paste, turmeric powder, coriander powder, degi red chili powder, a pinch of asafoetida and cook for a while.",
      "Add potatoes, water and cook for 2-3 minutes.",
      "Add cauliflower, salt to taste and give it a mix.",
      "Cover it with a lid and cook it for 12-15 minutes on medium flames.",
      "Finish it with lemon juice, ginger, green chillies, fresh coriander leaves, ghee and toss it gently.",
      "Transfer it to a serving dish, garnish it with ginger, green chillies and coriander sprig.",
      "Serve hot with roti.",
      "In the same kadai or pan, add prepared sabji, water and give it a quick boil.",
      "Transfer it to a serving dish, garnish it with ginger, green chillies and coriander sprig.",
      "Serve hot with roti."
    ],
